WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.480
We are all natural born learners.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.640
Full of determination, we take unimaginable risks.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.280
Exploding with curiosity, we&nbsp;
achieve the extraordinary.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.600
But as we grow up our love for&nbsp;
learning is put to the test.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.880
Some are told that they are not good enough.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.000
Or are given up on

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:28.000
While a few strive, many begin to&nbsp;
see their natural curiosity fade away

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.600
or begin associating learning with anxiety.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:35.760
Children can’t do much about that, but adults can.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.240
We can educate ourselves and change the experience&nbsp;
that kids have in our homes and classrooms.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:48.320
That is why we have built&nbsp;
a school for little people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.960
and share everything we learn along the way.

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:54.960
That's why we make videos that explain complex&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:01.360
social, psychological and pedagogical ideas&nbsp;
to new parents, students and teachers.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:07.600
And that is why we publish all our&nbsp;
materials via the creative commons license&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:12.640
and allow anyone to freely use them&nbsp;
for all sorts of educational purposes.

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:19.120
Today one million people have&nbsp;
subscribed to our channel,

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.560
over 50 million people have watched our videos

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:26.560
and our channel is sprouting&nbsp;
up in several major languages.

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:32.720
Your views, your likes and your meaningful&nbsp;
comments are what keeps us going.

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:36.640
And we want to thank every single&nbsp;
one of you who helped us get here!

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:42.560
On our website, you’ll find&nbsp;
all videos for download,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:45.920
plus additional resources&nbsp;
and classroom activities.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.160
If you want to support us, join&nbsp;
our community and become a Patron&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.160 --> 00:02:07.840
and help us change education, one mind&nbsp;
at a time! That's patreon.com/sprouts.

